WEBVTT

00:06:59.394 --> 00:07:00.581
pulling it down

00:07:00.605 --> 00:07:07.423
and then stopping the upload
of new material before it ever goes viral.

00:07:09.694 --> 00:07:11.340
Four years ago,

00:07:11.364 --> 00:07:12.903
when that case ended,

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:18.039
our team sat there,
and we just felt this, um ...

00:07:19.635 --> 00:07:22.973
... deep sense of failure,
is the way I can put it,

00:07:22.997 --> 00:07:26.648
because we watched that whole year

00:07:26.672 --> 00:07:27.992
while they looked for her.

00:07:28.016 --> 00:07:31.983
And we saw every place
in the investigation